kYaF7M5pOnGh2xFLE7MHxpn2pnsa9sA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs1NlOVvMwaAODs19fR03wgAEbfs5c5CXMkD8IoPNf91Q&oe=69A2E1A2"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.08.47.png", "id": "1426309168884035", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_1426309172217368_1019297969091737075_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uoamSJ_IKM8Q7kNvwHFuDGD&_nc_oc=AdmjI5E_RT8_-KTqdTiXVraXPR-vFZIdXKOiKiQf46H2ywrHFg_xm2mRmY_RbTTd-n8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuefIUZKk0pMhKScSTM2ZOD1CxnteBxUzDyeAIAZvtKoA&oe=69A2CF91"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.12.png", "id": "1791231008391357", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620432_1791231011724690_7646563548256713933_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3lK6Cx3mzfYQ7kNvwEatQA0&_nc_oc=AdmJ6PkZVc4TDTPI63_vMf-CPPjwnd5zcpnH1kp87NIpdZHW6UCotD7yKIniDgO8BeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfureEdjvHB4VwycA0acji8vzQzJsSS0u7FzJwYt0IwQlw&oe=69A2FA21"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.09.41.png", "id": "25923127443961648", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618264_25923127447294981_5221699009642254234_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kK1h6abqqKkQ7kNvwFuu3v2&_nc_oc=AdlhNy8J-g7xKekCYeqN3Ko05vCLGYEGG-qltUIFzWdpRzpuBwHXRPhkAirvg5cueU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBzsFAbLOkAbTy_Wv2AvjleOlHt6RhKAil6AVnHpcKBg&oe=69A2E670"}, {"file_name": "\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8 2026-01-09 14.10.18.png", "id": "1374499653759686", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618274_1374499657093019_1388091325729183700_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6h3JuzcjxmcQ7kNvwE7XSd7&_nc_oc=AdmI72WPoqN6iqWnB98zuqqNsB35pQltIjKyj5mySCjEd2JX0RbJMWEX26I6Kump7zQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvSDaCIYjwt0HevCgFNLMlizLu30yBbH3Xx_14Qrjk3xA&oe=69A2DAEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "S-Calculator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A stylish, simple, and easy-to-use calculator with a hidden feature\n\nA stylish calculator app with a design based on black.\nWe have simply gathered the functions needed for daily calculations, pursuing true ease of use.\n\n[Main Features]\n\u30fbBasic Functions: Arithmetic operations (+, -, \u00d7, \u00f7), percentage calculations, and sign switching (+/-).\n\u30fbUsability: Equipped with haptic feedback (vibration) when buttons are pressed.\n\u30fbDesign: Uses an eye-friendly dark mode and a highly readable programming font.\n\u30fbPrecision: Supports input of up to 15 digits, designed to minimize calculation errors.\n\n[Hidden Feature]\nTired of calculating? How about a little break?\nIf you tap the \"=\" button 5 times rapidly while in the initial state (when \"0\" is displayed), a hidden game mode will launch.\nPlease enjoy a simple yet engrossing side-scrolling action game.\n(Game Controls: Jump with \"0\", Return to calculator with \"AC\")\n\nMaking daily calculations a little more fun.\nWe hope you download and make use of it.", "short_description": "A stylish calculator designed in black. It distills daily functions into simplicity, created with a focus on pure usability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Lubyte", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://lubyte.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NO